# rdfs-subproperty-closure: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/rdfs-subPropertyOf.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:motherOf rdfs:subPropertyOf :parentOf. :parentOf rdfs:subPropertyOf :ancestorOf; rdfs:domain :Person; rdfs:range :Person. :alice :motherOf :bob.

# Inference rules
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.

{?P rdfs:subPropertyOf ?Q. ?S ?P ?O} => {?S ?Q ?O}.
{?P rdfs:subPropertyOf ?Q. ?Q rdfs:subPropertyOf ?R} => {?P rdfs:subPropertyOf ?R}.
{?P rdfs:subPropertyOf ?Q. ?Q rdfs:domain ?C} => {?P rdfs:domain ?C}.
{?P rdfs:subPropertyOf ?Q. ?Q rdfs:range ?C} => {?P rdfs:range ?C}.
